evidence.en:
To explain the great movement of military trucks in Varginha,
they said the vehicles were sent to the Automaco company for wheel balancing and steering alignment. However, the vehicles were seen on Saturday and Sunday, a period when Automaco is not open.
To explain the great movement of military personnel at the Regional Hospital, they alleged the cause as the exhumation of a young man's body that had hanged himself in jail. According to the exhumation report, this occurred on January 30, 1996;
